{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into this captivating 2D pixel art retro platformer and enter a world where speed and precision determine your success. With a total of 60 levels spread across 4 diverse worlds, you'll experience fast-paced single-screen action: collect all the gold coins, master treacherous traps, and overcome dangerous obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60 Challenging Levels:</strong> Each world features 20 unique levels that will test your speedrunner spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Art:</strong> A lovingly crafted aesthetic that reinterprets classic platformer action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precise Platforming:</strong> React in a flash to traps and obstacles in single-screen level designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Earn achievements and prove your skills in exciting challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Final Boss:</strong> Confront the ultimate enemy in a battle that decides the fate of a family.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure full of heart, action, and nostalgia\u2014and let yourself be captivated by <strong>Little Betty: Gold Rush</strong>!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Game Starter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470940/18c91a481d16e504b5c75761a2a6b9f7b75276ba.jpg"},{"name":"Pechvogel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470940/8ef688f1bda6e94cdd5e5b2ff505b6f2efe83d4f.jpg"},{"name":"Zu hart?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470940/a4073c1f838b443feb8e37022a04e39e1dbee8be.jpg"},{"name":"Hartn\u00e4ckig","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3470940/1